      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠰᠢᠷᠭᠣᠭᠣᠯᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>sirγuγulqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>шургуулах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>SIRΓUΓUL-</transcript>
      <definition>[v. caus. of sirγu-] To let someone crawl in or under; to put in or under stealthily; to shove in or under.</definition>
      <page>717</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠶᠠᠭᠤᠮ᠎ᠠ ᠪᠡᠨ ᠰᠢᠷᠭᠣᠭᠣᠯᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>jaγum-a ben --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To hide one's things in or under something.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
